      "owner": "pmo",
      "severity": "medium",
      "blocking": false,
      "summary": "The parent package status claim needs to stop at this slice. Architecture v6 `tasks.csv:27` makes FE-M3-PROJECTS the list and journey only, and lists A-PROJECT on it. The money half of A-PROJECT moves to FE-M3-REPORT (`tasks.csv:35`, which also lists A-PROJECT), and the tab acceptance A-PROJECT-TABS to FE-M3-PROJECT-TABS (`tasks.csv:34`). This feature proves only the JR-08 half of A-PROJECT (open a project, see every line and what is next, no grant gives 404). spec.md and readiness.md still say \"first part\", which is v5 wording. Expected: when FE-M3-PROJECTS is marked done, A-PROJECT stays open until FE-M3-REPORT passes, and no status says that milestones, documents, money, registers or actions work. Actual: nothing in the round files over-claims. build.md and review-qa.md limit themselves to the list and journey. This finding is a reminder for the coordinator's record update.",
