      "summary": "UX-1-1 and QA-1-1 are open and non-blocking, as the reviewers rated them. UX-1-1: lines with the same name give identical link text, so add a hidden \"line, state\" label. QA-1-1: a case_id with reserved characters is encoded twice (no effect with uuids and the mock). Neither blocks delivery. QA-1-1 must be rechecked at FE-CONNECT-1, and both go to the next round or a follow-up. They are named here so they are not lost.",
